  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-076-morandi\\06_voice\\master\\short303_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The commission asked the company for everything it had spent on structural work on the whole viaduct, and totalled it.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.573,
      "seconds": 5.573,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:70a40c00bd3ad8d79063c90590cc80f8c04d00f747f6ded7be82cfba2c5baf8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "From 1982 to 2018: twenty-four million, six hundred and ten thousand, five hundred euros.",
      "start": 5.793,
      "end": 11.877,
      "seconds": 6.084,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:ccf9669ae0fe42c68e96e8db5272a0ecd6a1a4c1ef79799a18cfffe0948f81f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Ninety-eight per cent of that was spent before 1999 — the year the motorway company was privatised. After 1999, two per cent.",
      "start": 12.097,
      "end": 20.317,
      "seconds": 8.22,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:9a04215797d7981a042493497e79058f88cab9ad28e93bf35234a7afede80008"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "In the seventeen years to 1999, it averaged one point three million euros a year. After, twenty-three thousand.",
      "start": 20.537,
      "end": 27.364,
      "seconds": 6.827,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:93a6d2faa777232feb3bab3dc762acc411ef8bca50931d30055e39a13bee43ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "The whole list of structural works on that bridge, over thirty-six years, is seven lines long.",
      "start": 27.584,
      "end": 33.157,
      "seconds": 5.573,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6c2a5c7d872b8fead43d8de011349f36af159a124e6ab5e5ceb0c55fe34e9a9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Then 2005: fifty thousand. 2015: two hundred and eighty-eight thousand. That is the whole of it.",
      "start": 33.377,
      "end": 39.739,
      "seconds": 6.362,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:a348de5621ca7314da9f889e99f7955620d0d1ce90b7f046e3e002786c032941"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "The commission drew the obvious conclusion, and it wrote it down in the language of the concession contract.",
      "start": 39.959,
      "end": 45.485,
      "seconds": 5.526,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:069895323d6dff2b934fc55ea0671fc1af722b520a53a9858db82c58076798c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Not doing simple ordinary maintenance today means wanting to do a great deal of extraordinary maintenance tomorrow, at certainly higher costs, with a mirror-image higher remunerativeness.",
      "start": 45.705,
      "end": 56.293,
      "seconds": 10.588,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:87cd07d6496fc4463ac0d5b4f227ca62f5338e20d64fb6ecbbe60df7bcdaa3be"
    }
  ]
}
